WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:02.912
Wow!

00:00:05.012 --> 00:00:05.838
What's up guys!

00:00:05.838 --> 00:00:06.783
We are Pongfinity

00:00:06.783 --> 00:00:09.159
We are back with another episode of Challenge Pongfinity

00:00:09.159 --> 00:00:10.124
Let's go!

00:00:11.451 --> 00:00:13.270
I think it's not going to work but...

00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:14.495
Let's give it a go!

00:00:16.329 --> 00:00:17.164
I got it

00:00:32.472 --> 00:00:33.676
Drop shot!

00:00:38.168 --> 00:00:39.000
Missed the smash

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.905
There is a lot of parts that you can hit it with

00:00:41.182 --> 00:00:43.492
You can also spin the wheels!

00:00:46.562 --> 00:00:48.429
Oh, what a shot!

00:00:54.924 --> 00:00:55.850
Come on!

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:57.386
That's enough of the chair!

00:00:57.894 --> 00:01:00.490
Okay, every shot has to bounce on your own
side first!

00:01:10.063 --> 00:01:10.886
Snakes!

00:01:23.624 --> 00:01:24.751
Good save!

00:01:26.234 --> 00:01:27.380
Long rally!

00:01:35.012 --> 00:01:36.289
This is really intense!

00:01:41.539 --> 00:01:44.014
We just need to put this point in the video!

00:01:48.617 --> 00:01:49.325
Come on!

00:01:49.325 --> 00:01:50.613
Miss already!

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.663
No!!!

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.550
How many shots was that?

00:01:55.942 --> 00:01:57.511
Somebody count that please

00:01:57.511 --> 00:01:58.946
This was quite fun

00:01:58.946 --> 00:02:01.063
It's just really hard to finish the point

00:02:01.063 --> 00:02:02.386
Just endless rallies

00:02:02.386 --> 00:02:03.366
Endless points

00:02:03.528 --> 00:02:04.605
So as you know

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:06.757
Miikka likes to move quite a lot

00:02:06.757 --> 00:02:09.478
So I think it's time to stabilize him a bit!

00:02:11.878 --> 00:02:14.414
I can do like very gentle footwork

00:02:14.414 --> 00:02:17.005
Miikka is looking quite like me right now

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:23.590
Looking good!

00:02:27.306 --> 00:02:29.430
Good technique on the backhand at least

00:02:29.557 --> 00:02:30.672
How is the forehand?

00:02:31.433 --> 00:02:32.908
That's good also!

00:02:33.796 --> 00:02:34.705
I've got it now!

00:02:39.288 --> 00:02:41.359
You look just like Otto!

00:02:41.532 --> 00:02:44.420
I'm not sure is that a compliment or an insult!

00:02:44.420 --> 00:02:45.850
I'm not sure which one is it?

00:02:46.069 --> 00:02:48.193
Now I found the right spot

00:02:49.243 --> 00:02:50.648
I can do anything now!

00:02:58.598 --> 00:03:00.765
Oh, 2 in a row!

00:03:11.411 --> 00:03:14.298
See, I almost saved it!

00:03:14.564 --> 00:03:16.982
Okay Miikka, time for some more

00:03:22.151 --> 00:03:23.393
Oh it's swaying!

00:03:23.393 --> 00:03:24.662
It's swaying a lot!

00:03:36.199 --> 00:03:37.423
Alright, last one

00:03:40.561 --> 00:03:41.621
Oh dear

00:03:43.202 --> 00:03:44.252
It's falling!

00:03:44.252 --> 00:03:45.239
No, it's not

00:03:45.239 --> 00:03:46.069
Keep it!

00:03:49.969 --> 00:03:52.189
Okay, we are done with the challenge

00:03:52.304 --> 00:03:55.666
So this is one of the most requested ideas on our channel

00:03:55.666 --> 00:03:58.556
We finally got enough fans to make this happen

00:03:59.018 --> 00:03:59.977
As you can see

00:04:00.981 --> 00:04:03.750
We have got some air condition equipment

00:04:04.085 --> 00:04:06.816
Well, just start placing them somewhere

00:04:09.298 --> 00:04:11.600
Well, that started promising!

00:04:12.465 --> 00:04:16.411
This is looking already quite interesting you could say

00:04:16.976 --> 00:04:18.274
It's not so powerful

00:04:18.724 --> 00:04:20.087
No, it's not on now

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.331
Ah, well no wonder!

00:04:22.573 --> 00:04:24.373
Okay I think everything is ready now

00:04:24.373 --> 00:04:26.533
So it's time to put the fans on!

00:04:27.052 --> 00:04:28.771
Wake up the wind guys!

00:04:28.995 --> 00:04:30.127
What do you guys think

00:04:30.127 --> 00:04:31.367
How will this go?

00:04:31.598 --> 00:04:34.109
This is our cable jungle

00:04:34.397 --> 00:04:36.262
This one's not a very good fan

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:38.731
Oh, I pressed it off. That's why.

00:04:40.508 --> 00:04:42.410
I'm sorry I yelled at you!

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:46.816
Where are they going?

00:04:49.031 --> 00:04:51.948
Ok, let's see if it has any effect

00:04:56.055 --> 00:04:57.074
Not that much

00:04:58.782 --> 00:05:00.000
Maybe if we play lower?

00:05:07.181 --> 00:05:08.658
We need to make it stronger

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:12.133
Ok now that should be a bit nasty

00:05:12.133 --> 00:05:15.463
So we have 9 fans directed onto one side

00:05:19.169 --> 00:05:20.876
It's still not too windy!

00:05:22.884 --> 00:05:25.937
It gives a little kick at the end but...

00:05:26.306 --> 00:05:29.474
There you can see it, swaying a bit in the
air

00:05:35.635 --> 00:05:37.735
I'm trying to feel what are the windy spots

00:05:37.735 --> 00:05:38.914
Maybe play here?

00:05:40.079 --> 00:05:45.007
Maybe there should be one guy controlling these with hands

00:05:45.007 --> 00:05:47.396
At least you don't get too hot while playing!

00:05:47.719 --> 00:05:48.978
It's very refreshing

00:05:49.324 --> 00:05:51.300
It's not that big of a difference to be honest

00:05:52.177 --> 00:05:56.435
I'd say let's try having all the fans blowing
in the same direction

00:06:09.703 --> 00:06:11.370
It looks normal to me!

00:06:14.309 --> 00:06:17.873
No, it just isn't working

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:20.713
We would need more powerful fans

00:06:20.713 --> 00:06:22.866
Okay, if this doesn't work

00:06:22.866 --> 00:06:23.919
Then nothing works!

00:06:26.815 --> 00:06:29.566
No! It's still not working!

00:06:29.566 --> 00:06:31.144
No effect at all

00:06:31.144 --> 00:06:33.795
I mean it doesn't affect anyhow it!

00:06:37.799 --> 00:06:39.343
It works so well!

00:06:42.377 --> 00:06:43.950
Watch out Miikka!

00:06:43.950 --> 00:06:45.364
Take a picture of me

00:06:49.725 --> 00:06:51.794
We finally made it work!

00:06:55.844 --> 00:06:58.642
There might also be wind to the other side!

00:07:03.880 --> 00:07:06.229
So much wind on that one!

00:07:06.448 --> 00:07:08.423
Ok, who are we kidding

00:07:08.423 --> 00:07:10.347
It's only Otto's side spin

00:07:11.339 --> 00:07:14.611
I think it's safe to say that this challenge is...

00:07:14.611 --> 00:07:16.765
Or this myth is busted!

00:07:16.765 --> 00:07:19.170
You can't change the direction with fans

00:07:20.185 --> 00:07:23.631
No, this is the maximum power you can get

00:07:31.200 --> 00:07:35.313
Yea, this was a really big disappointment

00:07:37.528 --> 00:07:41.524
I hope you guys don't get angry at us if we use this as the thumbnail!

00:07:42.366 --> 00:07:44.420
The most disappointing thumbnail ever!

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:45.278
Everybody will be like wow

00:07:45.279 --> 00:07:48.526
"They put all the fans on there and it's going to be crazy wind"

00:07:48.722 --> 00:07:49.791
But no...

00:07:49.929 --> 00:07:51.459
So that was all for today

00:07:51.459 --> 00:07:53.144
Don't forget to hit subscribe

00:07:53.144 --> 00:07:55.265
And go and check out our store [pongfinity.store]

00:07:55.426 --> 00:07:57.063
Until next time!

